# DeepSeek-V4-Flash: TP1 attention, DP4 requests, experts sharded across all 4 GPUs.
# Reproduces the topology in results/box-bench-scripts/launch_ds4flash_dp4ep4.sh.
# Later vllm_dp4 runs are promising, but their complete launch was not archived:
# this is a candidate for paired reruns, not a newly verified quality result.
# EP still communicates over PCIe; TP1 here does NOT mean independent replicas.
. "$(dirname "${BASH_SOURCE[0]}")/ds4flash_tp4.env"
CELL_NAME=ds4flash_dp4ep4
TP=1
DP=4
REPLICAS=1
GPU_IDS=0,1,2,3
ENABLE_EP=1
NOTES="TP1 DP4 EP4 candidate from archived successful launches; native weights, no speculative decoding by default. Reproduce with matched quality and workload. PCIe expert communication remains."
